@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Comprehensive Component Orchestration by ListGenerator (Excluding WebSocketManager)

actor "User" as User
participant "ListGenerator" as Orchestrator
participant "DoNotHackMyAppHelper" as Security
participant "ListSortBar" as SortBar
participant "SearchBar" as Search
participant "ListPagination" as Pager
participant "ListGeneratorHelper\n(renderData)" as TableRenderer
participant "MassEditWizard" as Wizard

== 1. Mount and Security Validation ==

User -> Orchestrator: Accesses list view with dataset: T[]
activate Orchestrator

Orchestrator -> Security: navigateToUnauthorized(checkAuth, actualUser, requiredAuth)
activate Security
Security --> Orchestrator: Authorized (Continues rendering cycle)
deactivate Security
note right of Security
  Prior permission check.
  See sequence diagram:
  "08_Sequence_DoNotHackMyApp_Route_Guard"
end note

== 2. Data Transformation Pipeline: Sorting ==

Orchestrator -> SortBar: Render with base data (data: T[])
activate SortBar

User -> SortBar: Selects sort by column (e.g., "name DESC")
SortBar -> Orchestrator: onSort(sortedDataset)
deactivate SortBar

Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: setSortedData(sortedDataset)

== 3. Data Transformation Pipeline: Search and Filtering ==

Orchestrator -> Search: Render with sorted data (data: sortedData)
activate Search

User -> Search: Enters search term (e.g., "role:ADMIN")
Search -> Orchestrator: setFiltered(filteredSubset)
deactivate Search

Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: Applies filters over sorted dataset\n(filteredData = filtered.length ? filtered : sortedData)

== 4. Pagination and Visible Data Resolution ==

Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: Calculates visible segment (paginatedData = slice(start, end))

Orchestrator -> Pager: Render controls (totalItems, pageSize, currentPage)
activate Pager

opt User changes page
    User -> Pager: Clicks next page
    Pager -> Orchestrator: onPageChange(newPage)
    Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: setPage(newPage) and clears previous selection
end
deactivate Pager

== 5. Item Selection and Keyboard Shortcuts ==

User -> Orchestrator: Presses "Ctrl + A" in view
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: useCtrlAToSelectOrDeselect: toggles selection of paginatedData

User -> TableRenderer: Checks individual checkboxes
TableRenderer -> Orchestrator: toggleSelectOne(id)
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: setSelectedIds(new Set(...))

== 6. Mass Edit Wizard Activation (MassEditWizard) ==

User -> Orchestrator: Clicks "Mass Edit" (selectedItems.length > 0)
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: setShowMassEdit(true)

Orchestrator -> Wizard: Mount modal with selectedItems: T[], massEditUri
activate Wizard
note right of Wizard
  Step-by-step editing cycle, Undo/Redo history
  and backend batch confirmation.
  See sequence diagram:
  "07_Sequence_MassEditWizard_UndoRedo_Persistence"
  and activity diagram:
  "19_Flow_MassEditWizard_UndoRedo_History"
end note

Wizard --> Orchestrator: onClose(updatedEntities)
deactivate Wizard

Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: Updates sortedData with mutated items
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: setShowMassEdit(false) and setSelectedIds(new Set())

== 7. Unified Final Rendering ==

Orchestrator -> TableRenderer: renderData({ paginatedData, selectedIds, keys, buttons })
TableRenderer --> User: Renders rows, checkboxes, action buttons, and counters

deactivate Orchestrator

@enduml
